---
title: Aumigo — Request Data Flow (submit adoption application)
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Adopter (browser)
  participant R as API route<br/>applications/index.post.ts
  participant G as Guard<br/>requireUser
  participant V as Validation<br/>adoptionApplicationCreateSchema
  participant S as AdoptionService
  participant P as PetRepository
  participant A as AdoptionRepository
  participant DB as Postgres (Drizzle)

  U->>R: POST /api/applications { body }
  R->>G: requireUser(event)
  alt no valid session
    G-->>U: 401 Unauthorized
  end
  G-->>R: session.user
  R->>V: useValidatedBody(body)
  alt invalid payload
    V-->>U: 422 Validation error
  end
  V-->>R: typed input
  R->>S: apply(input, userId)
  S->>P: find target pet
  P->>DB: SELECT pet
  DB-->>P: pet row
  P-->>S: pet
  alt pet not available / duplicate open application
    S-->>U: 409 Conflict
  end
  S->>A: insert application (status = pending)
  A->>DB: INSERT adoption_application
  DB-->>A: created row
  A-->>S: application
  S-->>R: application DTO
  R-->>U: 201 Created
  Note over S,A: Staff later review via<br/>/api/admin/applications/:id/review
